Executive Order

Uinta NationaL Forest
UTAH

By virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me by section 24 of the act
of March 3, 1891 (ch. 561, 26 Stat. 1095, 1103), and the act of June 4, 1897 (ch. 2, 30
Stat. 11, 34, 36), and upon the recommendation of the Secretary of Agriculture, it is
ordered that the following-described lands in the State of Utah be, and they are
hereby, included in and made a part of the Uinta National Forest:

